OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GLinton Stephens showcases the
OL,6,     Gbest performances from the UK and
OL,7,     Gbeyond, including pianist Kirill
OL,8,     GGerstein playing Rachmaninov's
OL,9,     GRhapsody on a theme of Paganini.
OL,10,G1500FChoral Evensong
OL,11,     GLive from St Paul's Cathedral,
OL,12,     Gwith music by Judith Bingham,
OL,13,     GWalmisley, Wood and Parry.
OL,14,G1600FComposer of the Week: Dvorak
OL,15,     GKate Molleson explores the life
OL,16,     Gand loves of Antonin Dvorak.
OL,17,     GToday, how his Catholic religion
OL,18,     Gshaped his music and soul.
